# The .xcodeproj IS committed, even though XcodeGen generates it: Xcode Cloud
# builds from a plain clone and fails with "does not exist at the root of the
# repository" if the project isn't there. project.yml stays the source of
# truth — after adding files, re-run `make project` and commit the result.
# Only the per-user state inside the bundle (xcuserdata) is ignored.

